<p>Hi <%= @application.user.name %>,</p>

<p>Thank you for applying to Fuime, the financial platform for teen-run businesses!</p>

<p>Before we can review your application, you <%= "and your parent or legal guardian (#{@application.cosigner_email})" if @application.cosigner_email.present? %> will need to sign the Fuime agreement.</p>
<p>Go to your <%= link_to "application status page", application_url(@application) %> to sign the agreement. <%= "You can also resend the agreement to your parent or legal guardian on this page." if @application.cosigner_email.present? %></p>

<p>
  Warmly,<br>
  The Fuime team
</p>
